25:["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4","children":["A tracking number is sent to the order email at the time of fulfillment and is also visible in your ",["$","a",null,{"href":"/account","className":"text-[var(--accent)] underline-offset-2 hover:text-[var(--accent-soft)] hover:underline transition-colors","children":"account dashboard"}],". Tracking updates are provided by the carrier; ","vialchemlabs"," does not control scan accuracy or carrier-side delays."]}]
